{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6146","title":"Meet POCO M8s 5G, a Powerful Battery Pioneer for Everyday Life","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today launched POCO M8s 5G, a new device featuring a massive battery, a stunning display, and reliable performance, built for long-lasting power and immersive everyday experiences.","view_cnt":"10960","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1776063583","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/317_operatorx_operatorx_opx/13/04/2026/255766debe1330e341db21e85a96dacd.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e[\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, April 20, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e]\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e– POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today launched POCO M8s 5G, a new device featuring a massive battery, a stunning display, and reliable performance, built for long-lasting power and immersive everyday experiences.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTwo-Day Battery Life Engineered to Last\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAt the core of POCO M8s 5G's user experience is a massive 7,000mAh (typ) battery capable of delivering up to 2-day battery life¹ on a single charge. Even at just 1% battery, users can still enjoy up to 59 minutes of calls or 7.5 hours of standby time,² ensuring they stay connected when it matters most. Engineered for reliability across different environments, the battery also maintains stable performance even in extreme cold conditions down to -20°C.² Delivering a long-life battery for extended daily use, POCO M8s 5G's battery retains 80% capacity or more even after 1,600 full charge cycles.³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/497_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/13/04/2026/237824ed3fed07944570d29745365076.jpg\" alt=\"The internal structure of a mobile phone, highlighting the 7000mAh battery, with the bottom part in black, the battery section in yellow, and the background in white.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO M8s 5G supports 33W fast charging⁴ for rapid top-ups, and 18W reverse charging.⁵ The Smart charging engine 2.0 is designed to further enhance the charging experience and extend battery life.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Cinema-View Display Meets Refined Design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eElevating every visual moment on POCO M8s 5G is an immersive 6.9-inch FHD+ display. It supports up to 144Hz refresh rate,⁶ delivering a smoother and more responsive visual experience. To support more comfortable viewing and reduce eye strain during long-term screen use, POCO M8s 5G has also received triple TÜV Rheinland eye-care certifications. Wet Touch Technology 2.0 also ensures reliable touch responsiveness even with wet or oily fingers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBeyond the immersive screen, POCO M8s 5G blends smooth curves inspired by nature to create a clean, timeless design. It also features a quad-curved back with a metal-crafted camera deco for a premium look.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/452_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/13/04/2026/1773a01da09d3095fc494036bf71a847.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmooth Performance Meets Every Demand\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePowered by the Snapdragon® 6s Gen 3 Mobile Platform, POCO M8s 5G delivers faster connectivity and reliable performance for everyday use. With up to 16GB RAM⁸ via memory extension and up to 2TB⁹ of expandable storage, users can enjoy smoother operation and store their favorite media content with ease. Running on Xiaomi HyperOS,¹⁰ POCO M8s 5G supports intelligent features such as Google Gemini¹¹ and Circle to Search with Google,¹² enabling faster access to information and smarter everyday interactions.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/573_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/13/04/2026/cd385da58364cbee03bdf674545c1181.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO M8s 5G's 50MP AI dual camera system empowers users to capture clear and vibrant images in diverse styles across a wide range of environments. Creative AI tools, including AI Erase and AI Sky, make it easier than ever to enhance photos, unlocking new possibilities for everyday creativity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eOther practical features include 200% volume boost¹³ support for immersive sound, a side-mounted fingerprint sensor for fast and secure unlocking, and IP64 dust and water resistance¹⁴ to overcome everyday challenges with ease.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO M8s 5G will be available in two colors: White and Black.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 6GB + 128GB, 8GB + 256GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ Data obtained from the light daily use model of POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ Data refers to the battery remaining at 80% or more capacity after 1600 battery life cycles. Data tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁴ Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁵ Supports up to 18W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through POCO Internal Labs testing. Actual performance may vary depending on battery conditions and other factors. When using this feature, please ensure your phone has sufficient battery and verify the compatibility of the receiving device.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁶ Refresh rate can be adjusted to up to 144Hz for supported apps.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁷ Data regarding dimensions and weight tested in POCO Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁸ 16GB RAM with memory extension is based on 8GB RAM version. Additional RAM will occupy a corresponding amount of ROM storage. Memory extension is only available when there is enough storage space on your device. Actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models. Configurations available may differ between different regions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁹ microSD card for expandable storage sold separately, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁰ Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS features, apps and services may vary depending on software version and product model.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹¹ Results are for illustrative purposes only and may vary. Check responses. Setup required. Compatibility and availability vary. 18+. Google and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹² Google and Android are trademarks of Google LLC. Available on select devices and internet connection required. Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Results may vary depending on visual matches. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹³ 200% volume compared to the same model at 100% volume. This feature only applies to media sounds, ringtones, and notification sounds, not alarms. Only available in speaker mode, not with headphones. Volume data tested by POCO Internal Labs. Please refer to your actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁴ The device with IP64 has been tested to be resistant to splash and dust in the presence of specific laboratory conditions with the classification IP64 ingress protection based on IEC 60529: 1989+A1:1999+A2:2013.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"276","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1776673879"},"common":null}